<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>OpenInfestation third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; }
  li.crate { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>OpenInfestation is built with the following open-source components. The Windows
executable statically links SDL2 (zlib license) through the <code>sdl2-sys</code>
crate. The Vulkan renderer embeds SMAA by Jorge Jimenez et al. (MIT license),
from <a href="https://github.com/iryoku/smaa">github.com/iryoku/smaa</a>.
The optional upscaler libraries (AMD FidelityFX FSR, Intel XeSS, NVIDIA DLSS)
are not part of this package.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>License texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section id="{{id}}">
  <h3>{{name}}</h3>
  <p>Used by:</p>
  <ul>
  {{#each used_by}}
    <li class="crate"><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
